_thumb/sc10ofg.jpg"}, {"id": 1711277, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofh.jpg"}, {"id": 1711270, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofa.jpg"}, {"id": 1711271, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofb.jpg"}, {"id": 1711285, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofp.jpg"}, {"id": 1711286, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofq.jpg"}, {"id": 1711269, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10of9.jpg"}, {"id": 1711280, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofk.jpg"}, {"id": 1711278, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofi.jpg"}, {"id": 1711281, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofl.jpg"}, {"id": 1711282, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofm.jpg"}, {"id": 1711283, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofn.jpg"}, {"id": 1711284, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofo.jpg"}, {"id": 1711288, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofs.jpg"}, {"id": 1711279, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofj.jpg"}, {"id": 1711287, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc10ofr.jpg"}], "slug": "atelier-shallie-alchemists-of-the-dusk-sea-dx", "storyline": "Water sources go dry.\n\nPlants wither and die.\n\nAll creatures thirst and starve.\n\nThe blue oceans turn to sand, and the life of the sea no longer has a place to call home.\n\nYet still, the sun continues to shine, mercilessly drying up what little water remains in the earth.\nSlowly, but surely, everything fades away to nothing in this Dusk World.\n\nIn the Dusk Sea that drains people's will to live lies a town of oasis located on the south.\n\nTwo young alchemists, with challenges that differ between each one, move forward together as they pursue the truth behind the Dusk once they cross paths.", "summary": "The third entry in the Atelier \"Dusk\" series. Two Shallies, Shallistera and Shallotte, join together in fulfilling their goals to learn the connections behind their own problems to the Dusk. Experience two different perspectives on how each Shallie face their challenges as they uncover truths about the Dusk. This entry introduces an evolved Synthesis system from previous Atelier \"Dusk\" games with new features such as figuring out effective routes to \"Chain Bonuses\" to create the best possible item, as well as a Turn-based Battle system heavily inspired by the \"Mana Khemia\" series that's known for its \"Burst\", \"Assist\", and \"Variable Strike\" combat mechanics while adding new features such as \"Field Bursts\" that turn the tide of battle.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/atelier-shallie-alchemists-of-the-dusk-sea-dx", "videos": [{"id": 30898, "name": "Game intro", "video_id": "SlOA96E_zME", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SlOA96E_zME", "title": "\u3010\u30b7\u30e3\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u30a2\u30c8\u30ea\u30a8\u3011\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SlOA96E_zME/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2501, "name": "Atelier: Dusk"}]}